    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "THIS LAND ACQUISITION APPEAL HAVING COME UP FOR ADMISSION ON 31.03.2026, THE COURT ON THE SAME DAY DELIVERED THE FOLLOWING:\n LA.APP. NO. 303 OF 2017 2026:KER:29186  2",
