      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "1  JUDGMENT State has filed this appeal against judgment and decree dated 21.11.2016 in L.A.R No.254 of 2013 on the file of Principal Sub Court, Kozhikode.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1038,
      "end": 1194,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "21.11.2016",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1113,
          "end": 1123
        },
        {
          "text": "L.A.R No.254 of 2013",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1127,
          "end": 1147
        },
        {
          "text": "Principal Sub Court, Kozhikode",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1163,
          "end": 1193
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Two parcels of land having extent of 0.81 Ares and 0.15 Ares in Re.Sy.61/9 of Vengeri Village were acquired from the 1st respondent for widening of Civil Station-Kottooli Road.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1195,
      "end": 1371,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vengeri Village",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1273,
          "end": 1288
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "2. Dissatisfied with the compensation granted by the Land Acquisition Officer, the 1 st respondent sought reference under Section 18 of the Land Acquisition Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1372,
      "end": 1534,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 18",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1495,
          "end": 1505
        },
        {
          "text": "Land Acquisition Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1513,
          "end": 1533
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "In the L.A.R, the Reference Court,\nrelying on the judgment in L.A.R No.233 of 2013 of the same Court, enhanced the land vlaue to Rs.3,00,000/- per cent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1535,
      "end": 1687,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "L.A.R No.233 of 2013",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1597,
          "end": 1617
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "State filed this appeal challenging the enhancement granted by the Reference Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1688,
      "end": 1771,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "3. When this appeal was taken up for hearing, it was pointed out by Sri. K.A.Salil Narayanan, the learned Counsel for the respondent, that in L.A.A Nos.403 of 2012 and connected cases, the land value re-fixed by the Reference Court was affirmed by this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1773,
      "end": 2032,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "K.A.Salil Narayanan",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1846,
          "end": 1865
        },
        {
          "text": "L.A.A Nos.403 of 2012",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1915,
          "end": 1936
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "A Division Bench, considered some identical appeals arising from the same acquisition in L.A.A Nos.500 of 2022 and connected appeals.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2033,
      "end": 2166,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "L.A.A Nos.500 of 2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2122,
          "end": 2143
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "By the judgment dated 30.05.2024, the LA.APP. NO. 303 OF 2017 2026:KER:29186 appeals were dismissed, taking note of the judgment in L.A.A Nos.403 of 2012 and connected cases.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2167,
      "end": 2341,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "30.05.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2189,
          "end": 2199
        },
        {
          "text": "LA.APP. NO. 303 OF 2017",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2205,
          "end": 2228
        },
        {
          "text": "L.A.A Nos.403 of 2012",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2299,
          "end": 2320
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "In view of the judgments dated 30.05.2024, in L.A.A Nos.500 of 2022 and connected appeals, this appeal is also dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2342,
      "end": 2464,
      "entities": [
        {
